@startuml

title PENA-Agent — Repository Cognitive Architecture

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam package {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #FFFCE8
}

actor "Developer / Architect" as Dev
actor "AI Assistant / Agent" as AI

package "pena-agent repository" {

  package "01-context" as CONTEXT
  package "02-intent" as INTENT
  package "03-benchmark" as BENCH
  package "04-planning" as PLAN
  package "05-specs" as SPECS
  package "06-vibepoc" as VIBE
  package "07-buildtest" as BUILD
  package "08-validate" as VALIDATE
  package "09-runtime" as RUNTIME
  package "10-observability" as OBS
  package "11-learning" as LEARN

}

rectangle "Repository Memory" as MEMORY
rectangle "Semantic Grounding" as GROUND
rectangle "AI Operational Context" as AICONTEXT

Dev --> CONTEXT : curates
Dev --> SPECS : refines
Dev --> VALIDATE : reviews
Dev --> LEARN : extracts lessons

AI --> CONTEXT : reads context
AI --> SPECS : uses specifications
AI --> BUILD : assists implementation
AI --> OBS : helps analyze signals

CONTEXT --> INTENT
INTENT --> BENCH
BENCH --> PLAN
PLAN --> SPECS
SPECS --> VIBE
VIBE --> BUILD
BUILD --> VALIDATE
VALIDATE --> RUNTIME
RUNTIME --> OBS
OBS --> LEARN
LEARN --> CONTEXT : feeds back

CONTEXT --> MEMORY
SPECS --> GROUND
LEARN --> MEMORY
MEMORY --> AICONTEXT
GROUND --> AICONTEXT

note bottom of MEMORY
The repository is not only a code container.
It is accumulated organizational memory.
end note

note right of AICONTEXT
AI behavior is shaped by:
- context quality
- specification clarity
- provenance
- feedback
- learning artifacts
end note

@enduml
